sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户(浏览器)
    participant App as App.tsx
    participant ST as PlanStore(zustand)
    participant API as src/api.ts
    participant RT as server/routes.ts
    participant ROS as shared/roster.ts
    participant TT as TaskTable/OwnerAutocomplete
    participant SC as shared/scheduler
    participant EX as Exporters

    %% ---------- A. 启动：名单改为写死常量 ----------
    U->>App: 打开页面
    App->>ST: init()
    ST->>API: getUsers()
    API->>RT: GET /api/users
    RT->>ROS: [...BUILTIN_USERS]
    ROS-->>RT: 21 人严格保序
    RT-->>API: {code:0, data:[...]}
    API-->>ST: users(=BUILTIN_USERS)
    ST->>Dialogs: UserGateDialog 展示 21 人(原序, 无 warning)

    %% ---------- B. 编辑负责人（复用 owner，不走排程） ----------
    U->>TT: 在「负责人」单元格输入
    TT->>TT: Autocomplete+freeSolo 候选过滤(原序/子串/高亮)
    U->>TT: 选中名单内 或 手填自由文本 确认
    TT->>ST: updateCell(id, 'owner', value.trim())
    ST->>SC: schedule(plan)   ★ owner 不参与任何分支
    SC-->>ST: computed(与改动前一致) + 无诊断
    ST-->>TT: 重绘(负责人列显示) + dirty=true(保存按钮激活)
    Note over ST: 保存仍需持锁 + notes 必填(既有约束, P0-8)

    %% ---------- C. 导出：CSV + MSPDI 含负责人 ----------
    U->>App: 导出 MS Project XML / CSV
    App->>API: exportUrl(planId, format)
    API->>RT: GET /api/plans/:id/export?format=...
    RT->>SC: schedule() 取权威 computed
    RT->>EX: toCsv(plan, computed)
    EX-->>RT: CSV 含「负责人」列(Group A 正确转义)
    RT->>EX: toMsProjectXml(plan, computed)
    EX->>EX: 收集 usedOwners -> Resources + Assignments
    EX-->>RT: XML(资源名=负责人, MS Project 可见)
    RT-->>U: 文件流(Content-Disposition: attachment)
